  .1D96 The latch
  .1D98 Disk change bit clear?
  .1D9A Yes: no change
  .1D9C Pulses bit 6
  .1DA1 To clear the change
  .1DA3 Still set?
  .1DA7 Yes
  .1DA9 Already seen?
  .1DAB Yes: go on
  .1DAD Records the drive as seen
  .1DB2 A = the drive

@1DB3 DIO_CHANGED
  The disk was changed: result $20.
  .1DB3 Result $20

@1DB5 DIO_REPORT_CHG
  Adds the drive bits in A to the changed drives at IY-$1E, returns B = this drive's bit if it is
