@1E2B DIO_OP_CMD
  Picks the controller command for the operation in D, once per sector: 1 read sector ($88), 2
  write sector ($A8), 3 verify (a read, $88), 4 write track ($F8), 5 read track ($E8), 6 read
  address ($C8).
  .1E2B Read?
  .1E2C Read sector
  .1E30 Write?
  .1E33 Verify?
  .1E37 Write track?
  .1E38 Write track
  .1E3C Read track?
  .1E3D Read track
  .1E41 Read address

@1F50 FDC_CMD_FLAGS
  Adds the settle bit (bit 2) to the command in A when the head moved, and sets the wait count:
  DE = $9331 when the motor runs, else 0 (65,536 passes).
  Entry: A = the command; IY-$16 = the flags.
  Exit: A = the command; DE = the wait count.
  Changes: AF, DE.
  Keeps: BC, HL, IX, IY.
  .1F50 Did the head move?
  .1F56 Yes: wait for it to settle
  .1F58 The wait while the motor runs
  .1F60 No: the longest wait

